  ],
  "engineeringFunctionality": "Usable local punching verification for constant-thickness reinforced-concrete slabs at interior, edge, and corner columns within the declared geometry scope. It supports first- and second-generation EN 1992 kernels, generated or explicit segment-based perimeters, automatic or assigned concentration factors, explicit punching-force reductions, and vertical studs or links with layout checks. Openings, beams, capitals, drops, wall ends, varying thickness, prestress, membrane compression, and proprietary reinforcement-system enhancements remain outside the implemented scope."
